        "source_note": "Coefficients from the bold Table 3 row with Equation BE1 (pages 807-810); alpha_KT is the printed alpha0*K0 = 0.0275 ± 0.0009 kbar/K converted to GPa/K.",
        "audit": "../audits/kcl.audit.json#kcl_walker_2002_bm3_2"
      },
      "model": "BM3",
      "temperature_ref": 296.15,
      "parameters": {
